      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "EDIT:\nAlso, the help topic below simply instructs wrong steps.\nVRChat uses \"EOS\" version of EAC, not \"standalone\" one.\nHowever, links to easy.ac pages in this page are listing steps for the latter.\nThat confuses users repairing EAC installation.\nhttps://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/8135250400915-I-m-having-issues-launching-VRChat-due-to-an-issue-with-Easy-Anti-Cheat-EAC-",
