  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-27T09:19:16.544Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When I start VRChat, the error \"Easy Anti-Cheat is not installed\" so I cannot launch VRChat. \nI found the EAC-official doc to repair EAC (the following link).\nHowever, I could not found 'EasyAntiCheat_Setup.exe' in 'EasyAntiCheat' folder. \nI found exe with similar name 'EasyAntiCheat_EOS_Setup.exe' but running it as administer does not working.\nWhat's the correct way to re-setup EAC?\nI've tried to re-installing VRC but not working.\nIt should be true this is not the bug of VRC but of EAC however EAC is a component of VRC so I reported here.\nhttps://www.easy.ac/en-us/support/game/guides/installer/",
